# Untitled

## High-throughput screening of carbon-supported single metal atom catalysts for oxygen reduction reaction
Yiran Wang<sup>1</sup>, Riming Hu<sup>1</sup>, Yongcheng Li<sup>2</sup>, Fuhe Wang<sup>3</sup>, Jiaxiang Shang<sup>1</sup> (✉), and Jianglan Shui<sup>1</sup> (✉)
